 "hook": "The Archigos dataset provides historical data the leaders of nearly 200 countries between 1875 and 2015. The dataset — a collaboration between political scientists Hein Goemans, Kristian Skrede Gleditsch, and Giacomo Chiozza — includes basic demographic information, plus categorizations of how each leader came to power, how they lost it, and their post-office fate.",
